WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:25.400
( Support Admin Watch on kissFlix.co )

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:48.960
[Genius Girlfriend]

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.890
[Episode 26]

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:17.240
[Yubai]

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:21.630
[You're on your way back home, right?]

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:36.630
[I'm a bit upset.]

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:37.030
[Jiang Yubai]

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:37.900
I'm a bit upset.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.330
Lin Lin Lin Lin Lin Zhixia.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:52.750
Hello,

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.500
this is my Genius Observation Diary.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:00.060
Observer—Jiang Yubai.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:04.260
On September 1st, 2013, the new semester

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.570
[Qingbei University]
[Welcome, new Qingbeiers.]

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.370
started at Qingbei University.

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.140
You said before that

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.970
you wanted everyone to be together

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:14.450
and never be apart.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.920
So I decided to come to Huacheng.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.430
Even though we couldn't meet,

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.710
it was still nice to be under the same sky

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:26.420
as you.

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:31.130
On September 24th, 2014,

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:33.330
you turned 20.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.130
-Happy birthday to you.
-Happy birthday to you.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.790
-Happy birthday to you.
-Happy birthday to you.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.470
-Happy birthday to you.
-Happy birthday to you.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.550
Happy birthday to you.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:44.400
Happy birthday!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.600
I saw you celebrating

00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:48.920
your birthday with them
at the restaurant today.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.250
I heard you wishing

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.909
everyone could reunite soon,

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:54.740
and I could come back soon.

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.810
You are the only one missing.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.300
We are waiting for you.

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:01.610
But you didn't know

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:03.710
that I had never left.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:09.000
I was just not sure when

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.340
I could return to your side.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.330
On September 7th, 2018,

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.420
actually, that day in speech class,

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.150
you weren't imagining it—

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:26.090
I was right there with you.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:30.560
But I was hiding from you

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.950
because you were running
further and further away

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.280
toward a bright future.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:35.880
I was afraid that

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.159
I would never be able
to catch up with you.

00:06:39.159 --> 00:06:42.130
On September 13th, 2018...

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.190
You were looking for me?

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.180
Did I have to appear
just because you were looking for me?

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.130
Then what does this watch
have to do with you?

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.250
Why did you fix it?

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:52.370
You had been hiding for 5 years!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.659
Why did you show up now?

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:56.380
Why didn't you just keep hiding?

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.130
Yes!

00:06:58.450 --> 00:06:59.810
Yeah, I shouldn't have fixed it.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:00.540
I'm an idiot.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.810
My biggest regret now is

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.240
ever fixing this stupid watch.

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:05.170
I should never have let you find me!

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:07.930
Lin Zhixia,

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.610
I didn't mean to push you away.

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.950
And neither did I
want to break your heart.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:17.700
I know my actions disappointed you.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.190
Actually, I really regretted it that day.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.220
I felt so powerless.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.750
But I didn't know what to do.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.400
I love you so much.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:31.270
But...

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.370
I'm sorry.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.370
On November 20th, 2018,

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:42.210
your brother asked me to take care of you.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.300
I was really happy.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.180
I didn't know when a genius

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.580
could understand ordinary people's love,

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:51.540
but I still decided

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:54.630
to bury these feelings in your place.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.070
Because I firmly believed that one day,

00:07:58.390 --> 00:07:59.740
you would hear my voice.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.080
Lin Zhixia,

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:11.600
thank you for hearing me out.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.070
And also thank you

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:17.350
for having given me the motivation
to move forward for the past 5 years.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:17.980
Now,

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:22.600
please press X and Y
on the model simultaneously.

00:08:37.909 --> 00:08:42.120
[Jiang Yubai loves Lin Zhixia
forever and ever.]

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:02.440
Jiang Yubai, where are you?

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:04.070
I want to see you right now.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.800
Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai!

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.480
♪ Warm fishbowl ♪

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.930
♪ 2013 ♪

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.000
♪ 16 times faster ♪

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:45.010
♪ The night is like a window ♪

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.590
♪ The night is like the sea ♪

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:52.660
♪ Also like all the memories ♪

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.810
♪ Frozen in frame ♪

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.510
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:59.600
♪ Your heart is ♪

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:02.220
♪ A rotten one ♪

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.530
♪ Silently fading ♪

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.200
♪ Vanishing without a trace ♪

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.600
♪ I walked in ♪

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.740
♪ But couldn't find ♪

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:14.580
♪ The exit ♪

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:16.630
♪ You dwell within ♪

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.280
♪ My daylight flight ♪

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:22.170
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.280
♪ Boundless, endless ♪

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.720
♪ Can barely breathe ♪

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:29.110
♪ Sinking to the seabed ♪

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.620
♪ I don't know ♪

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:35.430
♪ Why ♪

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:41.780
Jiang Yubai.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:45.980
I like you.

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:51.290
-What kind of like do you mean?
-I mean the kind

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:52.870
of like you're thinking.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.580
It's the philosophical

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.580
and biological kind of like.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.320
The ordinary kind of like.

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:05.630
Actually, I've forgotten

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:07.860
since when

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.990
I started falling for you, Lin Zhixia.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.010
But I've often set deadlines for myself.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:15.530
I wanted to wait

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:18.120
until I became an older

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:20.350
and better person.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.690
But the more time passed,

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:26.820
the more I doubted

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.470
whether I, Jiang Yubai,
would be lucky enough

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:32.480
to always be able to protect

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:34.620
and like Lin Zhixia.

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:38.770
Because I always felt that love was

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.820
not very important to her.

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:46.380
So being able to stay by your side

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:48.750
already made me very happy.

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.100
I'm prepared.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.330
Even if Lin Zhixia
doesn't know my feelings,

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:58.670
I still...

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.890
Lin Zhixia knows.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:11.980
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:16.990
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

00:13:17.390 --> 00:13:20.520
♪ These unspoken feelings
