[Hematology Department]

00:13:58.090 --> 00:13:58.420
[Class Break]

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:01.010
[Class Break]

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:01.150
Are you telling everyone you're dating?

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:01.980
[As expected. Congratulations.]

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:02.080
So suddenly!

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.440
[This is way too sudden.
Still, congratulations.]

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:04.620
Mm.

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:06.580
As expected.

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:07.830
Congratulations!

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:10.170
This is way too sudden.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.160
Still, congratulations.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.100
Congratulations. You two deserve this.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:49.750
Lin,

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.620
Professor Wu has been
strongly recommending you,

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:54.290
saying that you are the top talent
in the industry.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:56.740
We are currently focusing our efforts
on artificial intelligence.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:57.440
Right now,

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:59.840
we are doing R&D
on machine learning algorithms.

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.440
We really need you to join us.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.820
Ling, thank you for choosing me.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.790
But I have no plans
to leave school for now.

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:10.820
It's not too late to start planning now.

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:11.790
Scientific research talents

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.920
need support and protection the most.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.030
The school environment is

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.840
definitely not as good as our company's.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.480
The funding we've invested now

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:19.810
is several times yours.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:26.100
Ling, you might not know this.

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.500
My current project's research direction

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:30.100
only requires computing power.

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:32.360
The school's support is already enough.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.370
Is it the pay

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.650
that's holding you back?

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:36.860
If you think it's too low,

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:37.820
I can go back

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:38.860
and talk to our boss.

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.100
Everything is negotiable.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.170
No, it's not like that.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.700
It's not about the salary.

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:44.860
I'm personally

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.940
very into this research direction.

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:48.580
I have no reason to give it up.

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:50.700
Then do you have any other needs?

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.170
We will surely satisfy you

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:54.300
as long as it's within our capability.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.620
I haven't thought about it yet.

00:15:58.050 --> 00:15:59.010
I'm sorry.

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:01.150
Okay, fine.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.150
How about this?

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:03.820
This is my business card.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:05.620
You can also take the contract back
and have a look.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.240
If you have any needs,

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:09.050
feel free to contact me, okay?

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.120
The rod tip

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.820
and the grip
have both been modified, right?

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:26.250
Yep.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.630
The rod tip was replaced
with T1100G carbon cloth.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:31.220
It's 30% lighter.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.390
As for the handle,

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:33.530
it was replaced with a baitcasting reel.

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:35.840
You'll have better balance when casting.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:36.970
Nice modification.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:40.290
Not bad, young man.

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:42.770
You're not only
good at dealing with stereos

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:44.700
but also an expert in fishing rods.

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:47.390
This is for you.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:53.900
Wait a minute.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.790
Are there any strings attached this time?

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:00.500
Nope,

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:03.130
I just simply want to thank you

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:06.500
for going to listen
to Lin Zhixia's project presentation.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.740
No wonder.

00:17:09.829 --> 00:17:10.660
Alright.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:12.599
How about this?

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.880
I have a few more rods in my car.

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.069
Modify them all for me.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:26.290
Oh, Liu.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.540
Fine, I'll modify them for you.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.220
But I recently took some urgent orders.

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:33.330
It'll take a while before I get it done.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:33.980
No,

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.420
I'm going sea fishing next week.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:37.660
I can't wait.

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:42.250
All right, then I'll work overtime

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:44.070
and let you jump the queue.

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:47.940
Great, really nice.

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:52.770
Everyone,

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:55.110
I'm sure you're well aware

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.960
of what we're going to discuss here today.

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:58.690
So I won't beat around the bush.

00:17:58.770 --> 00:17:59.570
Up here is

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.050
a detailed price evaluation report

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:03.980
that I made.

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:07.090
Whether we should hire Zhou Heng

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.850
or an ambassador—

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:11.420
I think it's pretty obvious which one

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.270
is more cost-effective

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.770
and will bring our company

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:16.660
long-term benefits.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:23.980
Hou Wei,

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.180
do you have anything else to add?

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:29.010
I have nothing to say.

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:29.980
Let's vote.

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:33.780
Raise your hands
if you agree to bring in Zhou Heng.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.810
Duan, just sign it.

00:18:58.420 --> 00:18:59.940
So all of you are only willing

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:01.770
to do these superficial vanity projects,

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:02.460
right?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.740
Calm down first.

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:04.610
Duan,

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.460
for a small company like ours,

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.250
we need to build our hype first.

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:10.140
Getting acquired is

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.060
already the best way out for us.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.290
So your goal is

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:17.550
to quickly stir up some hype,

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.940
cash out, and run?

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:22.000
Do you really want to build it
into a century-old brand?

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:29.180
Fine, if you want to find a buyer,

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:31.610
feel free to go talk to them.
Just go right away.

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:32.680
I'll sign it for you

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.410
whenever you get the deal done.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:38.410
Selling the company as soon as possible
is good for everyone.

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:43.530
[Fun Biking]

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:58.610
You've already been here for several days
before telling me.

00:19:58.610 --> 00:19:59.610
You're so biased.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.740
We're not biased.

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:04.660
If we told you, you'd worry about us.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:06.660
We didn't want to delay your work.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.150
Dad, what's wrong with your back?

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:17.550
It's nothing. An old problem.

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:21.420
Lumbar disc herniation.

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:22.770
He already had this old injury,

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:24.700
and he strained it again this time.

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:26.740
He kept refusing to go to the hospital.

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.740
Whenever it flared up,
he'd just put on a plaster himself.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.460
If Zeqiu and I
hadn't persuaded him this time,

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:32.660
he wouldn't have gone to see the doctor.

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:34.250
So did you go see a doctor?

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.460
Yes, I did. I'm fine.

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:39.470
What did the doctor say?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.070
It's nothing serious for now.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.000
It can be treated conservatively.

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:45.750
But the doctor said that

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:47.240
he couldn't do heavy work anymore.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:49.090
If he gets hurt doing heavy work again,
he'll need surgery.

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:50.090
Did you hear that?

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:52.090
He just won't listen to me.
Talk sense into him.

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:54.900
Dad! How many times have I told you?

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.810
Just stop running that supermarket.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.090
It doesn't turn a profit anyway.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:20:58.920
If it exhausts you and Mom

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:00.220
and ruins your health,

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:01.550
what will Zeqiu and I do?

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.050
See?

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:05.140
You didn't listen to me before.

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:06.570
Now, my sister is saying it, too.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:07.430
What do you say?

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:08.900
Would you think it over?

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.420
Your mom and I are

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:12.900
just sitting around anyway.

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.770
Running this small supermarket

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:16.140
allows us to do something.

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:16.770
Besides,

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.500
you'll have a lot of expenses
ahead of you.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.500
Mom, Dad,

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.140
I'm making money now.

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:24.850
Our family's finances will

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:26.710
surely take a turn for the better.

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.380
Why don't you and Mom

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:30.780
just stay at home
and enjoy a peaceful life?

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:32.610
You want me to just idle around
before death?

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:33.610
I didn't say that.

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:39.740
The doctor said it was nothing serious.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:41.960
Your mom and I just thought

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:44.090
we'd drop by and visit you two.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.410
Now that we have seen you,

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:48.330
we'll head back in a couple of days.

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:49.050
No way.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.330
You have to stay and get treated properly.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:54.420
Only when the doctor says
you're completely fine

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:55.220
can you leave.

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:06.070
Fine.

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:13.740
Stop laughing.

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:16.740
Everything has its nemesis.

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:19.310
I'll settle the score with you later.

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:24.180
Don't change the channel.
Let's watch this.

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:25.610
Get up a bit. I'll put...

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:26.660
Put a cushion behind you.

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:27.390
Take it slow.

00:22:28.250 --> 00:22:29.700
Yes, yes, slowly.

00:22:30.220 --> 00:22:32.020
Is it more comfortable this way?

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:33.460
From now on, you have to tell me

00:22:33.460 --> 00:22:35.050
anything happening at home immediately.

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:36.250
Don't hide it from me.

00:22:38.090 --> 00:22:39.460
I didn't hide anything from you.

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:40.990
Mom asked me not to tell you,

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:42.730
afraid you'd be worried.

00:22:43.050 --> 00:22:45.380
You didn't tell me
just because Mom told you not to?

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:46.250
You traitor.

00:22:47.700 --> 00:22:49.760
Then next time, I'll tell you at once.

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:55.990
What else haven't you told me?

00:22:58.460 --> 00:22:59.090
Nothing.

00:23:04.140 --> 00:23:05.070
Really nothing.

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:08.290
Those things on your desk are

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:10.980
not all yours, are they?

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:14.180
They are all mine.

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:15.090
All of them.

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:18.120
Not a single thing
belongs to someone else?

00:23:18.180 --> 00:23:19.700
No, I bought them all.

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:22.810
Forget it if you don't want to tell me.

00:23:22.810 --> 00:23:24.870
I'll find out sooner or later anyway.

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:28.100
I really don't get
what you're talking about.

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:30.610
You're hiding something.

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:31.610
No.

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:33.420
I'm not.

00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:58.300
What's wrong?

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:00.390
Why are you pulling a long face?

00:24:07.530 --> 00:24:09.660
My dad came to see the doctor this time,

00:24:12.140 --> 00:24:12.940
and I realized

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:14.900
how much he had aged.

00:24:18.290 --> 00:24:20.310
If he does any more heavy work,

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:22.110
he'll need surgery for his back.

00:24:22.900 --> 00:24:24.090
When it hurts now,

00:24:24.250 --> 00:24:25.530
even medicated plasters don't work.

00:24:25.530 --> 00:24:26.730
He just has to bear it.

00:24:28.140 --> 00:24:29.400
Do you need money then?

00:24:30.420 --> 00:24:31.740
My average transaction value
has gone up lately...

00:24:31.740 --> 00:24:32.540
Don't bother.

00:24:32.810 --> 00:24:34.610
You don't need to worry about it.

00:24:38.980 --> 00:24:41.310
I just want to take
some pressure off them.

00:24:43.180 --> 00:24:46.840
I don't want Zeqiu to carry the burden
of the family all by himself.

00:24:47.290 --> 00:24:49.490
He'll have his own family in the future.

00:24:51.050 --> 00:24:52.500
If I go out to work,

00:24:52.900 --> 00:24:54.290
my mom, dad, and brother will

00:24:54.290 --> 00:24:56.020
have it a little easier, right?

00:24:58.810 --> 00:24:59.740
I think

00:25:00.770 --> 00:25:01.830
you've got a point.

00:25:03.180 --> 00:25:04.010
However,

00:25:04.500 --> 00:25:06.100
you should also ask yourself

00:25:07.090 --> 00:25:09.220
what you really want deep down inside.

00:25:11.570 --> 00:25:13.570
I want to stay in school, of course.

00:25:13.940 --> 00:25:16.900
There are still many projects
I haven't figured out yet.

00:25:16.900 --> 00:25:18.630
If I go to a commercial company,

00:25:19.140 --> 00:25:21.340
I'll be doing other people's projects.

00:25:23.770 --> 00:25:24.380
I also think

00:25:24.380 --> 00:25:27.440
doing scientific research in school
suits you better.

00:25:29.380 --> 00:25:30.380
Have you asked for

00:25:30.420 --> 00:25:31.820
your brother's opinion?

00:25:33.500 --> 00:25:34.610
He won't agree.

00:25:35.420 --> 00:25:36.680
I know he cherishes me.

00:25:38.830 --> 00:25:40.250
When he was still a college student,

00:25:40.250 --> 00:25:42.910
he already did part-time jobs
in his spare time,

00:25:43.380 --> 00:25:46.010
just in order to shoulder
the family's burden earlier.

00:25:46.010 --> 00:25:47.940
But I'm also a member of the family.

00:25:53.010 --> 00:25:54.610
I know what you're thinking.

00:25:55.140 --> 00:25:55.980
But

00:25:56.330 --> 00:25:57.860
don't jump to conclusions.

00:25:58.250 --> 00:25:59.650
Take time to think it over

00:26:00.180 --> 00:26:01.980
and discuss it with your family.

00:26:02.420 --> 00:26:04.020
Whatever decision you make,

00:26:04.980 --> 00:26:06.580
I'll be with you by your side.

00:26:30.290 --> 00:26:30.940
Ms. Ling,

00:26:31.570 --> 00:26:33.460
I'd like to talk with you again about

00:26:33.460 --> 00:26:35.120
what you brought up last time.

00:26:35.570 --> 00:26:36.590
Great, Lin.

00:26:36.900 --> 00:26:38.010
You've changed your mind?

00:26:38.010 --> 00:26:39.810
I'll make time for it right away.

00:26:41.480 --> 00:26:44.280
Touch up quickly
and get ready for the next outfit.

00:26:45.220 --> 00:26:46.680
Alright, look right here.

00:26:47.940 --> 00:26:49.800
Good, you can smile a little more.

00:26:49.940 --> 00:26:51.940
Great. You're looking really good.

00:26:52.290 --> 00:26:54.220
One more. Let me try another angle.

00:26:54.480 --> 00:26:55.980
These are clothes for Su Mo later.

00:26:55.980 --> 00:26:56.900
Ask the director which one works best

00:26:56.900 --> 00:26:57.740
and have him change into it.

00:26:57.740 --> 00:26:58.740
Got it, Tingting.

00:27:03.980 --> 00:27:05.140
Tingting, check it out.

00:27:05.140 --> 00:27:06.740
What do you think of his look?

00:27:06.980 --> 00:27:08.080
If everything's good,

00:27:08.080 --> 00:27:09.540
we'll move to the next set.

00:27:09.850 --> 00:27:10.570
Let me see.

00:27:12.940 --> 00:27:14.180
Okay, very good.

00:27:20.740 --> 00:27:23.900
Jiang, I've just realized—

00:27:25.050 --> 00:27:28.770
t-these so-called friends I grew up with

00:27:29.550 --> 00:27:32.720
are all so fake and hypocritical!

00:27:34.660 --> 00:27:35.520
That's enough.

00:27:35.660 --> 00:27:36.660
You should drink less.

00:27:36.660 --> 00:27:37.920
Oh, right, there's...

00:27:39.050 --> 00:27:41.290
one more thing about Tang Tingting.

00:27:44.350 --> 00:27:46.080
I really don't understand her.

00:27:46.770 --> 00:27:47.700
What did I do

00:27:48.660 --> 00:27:50.850
to mess with her all day?

00:27:52.740 --> 00:27:54.050
I feel like in her eyes,

00:27:54.460 --> 00:27:59.290
I can't do anything right.

00:28:06.380 --> 00:28:09.660
I can't do anything right.

00:28:10.140 --> 00:28:12.050
I just feel like I'm nobody.

00:28:12.050 --> 00:28:13.500
I'm a total loser!

00:28:18.220 --> 00:28:19.950
I think this looks pretty good.

00:28:20.050 --> 00:28:21.050
Let's call it a day.

00:28:21.050 --> 00:28:21.900
Okay, sure.

00:28:22.220 --> 00:28:22.850
Alright,

00:28:23.660 --> 00:28:24.420
it's a wrap.

00:28:24.660 --> 00:28:25.860
Great job, everyone.

00:28:26.700 --> 00:28:27.770
Not bad.

00:28:28.180 --> 00:28:29.010
Thank you, Yu.

00:28:29.220 --> 00:28:29.810
Keep it up.

00:28:29.810 --> 00:28:31.420
Great job, everyone! Thank you all!

00:28:31.420 --> 00:28:32.460
Well done.

00:28:33.570 --> 00:28:34.290
Tingting.

00:28:35.770 --> 00:28:37.500
Did I do a really good job today?

00:28:37.850 --> 00:28:39.250
You did great. Keep it up.

00:28:39.290 --> 00:28:40.220
Good work today.

00:28:40.740 --> 00:28:42.140
You've been busy all day.

00:28:42.140 --> 00:28:44.400
Come and grab a bite with everyone later.

00:28:44.530 --> 00:28:45.330
My treat.

00:28:45.570 --> 00:28:46.900
I'm not going.
I have something urgent to handle.

00:28:46.900 --> 00:28:48.500
You guys go ahead. It's on me.

00:28:48.660 --> 00:28:49.380
What is it?

00:28:49.380 --> 00:28:51.180
Do you have to handle it tonight?

00:28:51.900 --> 00:28:52.980
It's about that unlucky friend of mine.

00:28:52.980 --> 00:28:54.290
I don't know what's wrong with him again.

00:28:54.290 --> 00:28:55.180
He's probably drunk too much.

00:28:55.180 --> 00:28:56.510
I have to go check on him.

00:28:56.660 --> 00:28:57.500
You go ahead.

00:28:58.010 --> 00:28:59.180
Good job, guys!

00:29:01.770 --> 00:29:04.010
Tingting, be careful then!

00:29:04.500 --> 00:29:05.140
Okay.

00:29:06.250 --> 00:29:07.770
I came up with the idea

00:29:07.770 --> 00:29:10.050
and built the company myself from scratch.

00:29:10.050 --> 00:29:11.460
Now they're kicking me out!

00:29:11.460 --> 00:29:13.740
Is there no justice anymore? Is there...

00:29:13.740 --> 00:29:14.460
Who's it?

00:29:16.180 --> 00:29:17.380
What brings you here?

00:29:18.610 --> 00:29:20.470
What's this show today, Mr. Duan?

00:29:21.420 --> 00:29:23.550
No show. It's nothing.

00:29:24.570 --> 00:29:25.700
Stubborn as always.

00:29:26.220 --> 00:29:28.350
Did you run into trouble at work again?

00:29:32.250 --> 00:29:35.570
The company... That's just a small issue.

00:29:37.140 --> 00:29:38.050
A small issue?

00:29:38.250 --> 00:29:39.700
You got this drunk over a small issue?

00:29:39.700 --> 00:29:41.230
Can this solve the problem?

00:29:44.010 --> 00:29:44.810
Nope.

00:29:44.980 --> 00:29:46.310
Then what should you do?

00:29:47.820 --> 00:29:49.340
What should I do, Jiang?

00:29:50.010 --> 00:29:51.460
I don't know either.

00:29:51.460 --> 00:29:53.120
I'm asking what you should do.

00:29:56.810 --> 00:29:57.610
I should...

00:29:58.290 --> 00:30:00.220
I should go communicate with them!

00:30:01.180 --> 00:30:03.050
Do you know how?
Do you need me to teach you?

00:30:03.050 --> 00:30:04.900
No need! I know how!

00:30:06.700 --> 00:30:07.740
Are you still drinking then?

00:30:07.740 --> 00:30:09.460
No. You drink,

00:30:09.980 --> 00:30:10.570
Jiang.

00:30:10.810 --> 00:30:11.570
I'll drink.

00:30:12.420 --> 00:30:13.950
Alright, I'm leaving then.

00:30:19.050 --> 00:30:19.710
I'm hungry.

00:30:27.180 --> 00:30:28.250
Oh, man...

00:30:28.500 --> 00:30:30.960
Let's go, Jiang.
Let's grab a bite together.

00:30:31.290 --> 00:30:32.570
I will skip this one.

00:30:32.610 --> 00:30:33.670
You guys go and eat.

00:30:34.900 --> 00:30:36.870
Come and grab a bite, Jiang.

00:30:38.090 --> 00:30:38.700
Come on.

00:30:54.770 --> 00:30:55.810
Why are you looking at me?

00:30:55.810 --> 00:30:57.540
Aren't you hungry? Just eat up.

00:30:58.900 --> 00:30:59.610
Tingting,

00:31:00.220 --> 00:31:02.350
you're the only one who treats me well.

00:31:02.700 --> 00:31:05.140
You've ignored me for such a long time.

00:31:05.420 --> 00:31:07.620
I thought I'd never get to see you again.

00:31:08.500 --> 00:31:10.500
If you act this foolish again
after drinking,

00:31:10.500 --> 00:31:12.160
you really won't see me again.

00:31:13.380 --> 00:31:14.010
Tingting,

00:31:14.810 --> 00:31:16.050
although I don't know

00:31:16.050 --> 00:31:18.770
why you've been sulking lately,

00:31:19.250 --> 00:31:20.560
I do know one thing.

00:31:20.710 --> 00:31:22.610
It must be because I offended you somehow

00:31:22.610 --> 00:31:23.810
and made you unhappy.

00:31:26.770 --> 00:31:29.090
I apologize to you, Tingting.

00:31:29.940 --> 00:31:31.140
Can you let it go?

00:31:32.610 --> 00:31:34.010
Didn't you claim that you'd find

00:31:34.010 --> 00:31:36.290
an inverse function
that's completely different from me?

00:31:36.290 --> 00:31:38.570
That noodle shop lady is
gentle and considerate.

00:31:38.570 --> 00:31:39.570
Isn't she your ideal type?

00:31:39.570 --> 00:31:41.380
Why do you want to come to me?
Just go find her.

00:31:41.380 --> 00:31:42.440
It's not like that.

00:31:43.330 --> 00:31:45.460
I've only dined there a couple of times

00:31:45.530 --> 00:31:48.330
and chatted casually.
When did I ever look for her?

00:31:48.610 --> 00:31:49.700
Keep chatting then.

00:31:49.700 --> 00:31:51.760
I think you two are quite a good match.

00:31:52.270 --> 00:31:54.140
It's really not what you think.

00:31:54.250 --> 00:31:55.330
I'm not familiar with her at all.

00:31:55.330 --> 00:31:56.140
I have meals there

00:31:56.140 --> 00:31:57.220
simply because her place

00:31:57.220 --> 00:31:58.380
is close to my company.

00:31:58.380 --> 00:31:59.290
That's all.

00:31:59.660 --> 00:32:00.880
We've never talked

00:32:00.880 --> 00:32:01.940
about anything else.

00:32:01.940 --> 00:32:03.380
Every time I finish eating,

00:32:03.380 --> 00:32:04.590
I'm only being polite and saying goodbye

00:32:04.590 --> 00:32:05.200
when leaving.

00:32:05.200 --> 00:32:06.090
That's all.

00:32:06.090 --> 00:32:07.330
I don't even have her WeChat.

00:32:07.330 --> 00:32:08.500
How is that even knowing her?

00:32:08.500 --> 00:32:09.630
You've got me wrong.

00:32:10.220 --> 00:32:11.950
Why are you explaining it to me?

00:32:12.010 --> 00:32:13.410
It's none of my business.

00:32:19.610 --> 00:32:21.140
Of course I have to explain.

00:32:24.460 --> 00:32:26.050
I can't let you stay mad.

00:33:01.980 --> 00:33:02.770
I'm full.

00:33:28.420 --> 00:33:29.530
Mom, Dad, Zeqiu,

00:33:29.850 --> 00:33:32.000
you don't have to worry
about money anymore.

00:33:32.000 --> 00:33:32.850
I found a job

00:33:33.200 --> 00:33:34.000
with good pay.

00:33:35.050 --> 00:33:35.850
The signing bonus is high,

00:33:35.850 --> 00:33:37.380
and the annual salary is good.

00:33:37.380 --> 00:33:40.380
They want me to join
as soon as I get my doctoral degree.

00:33:42.740 --> 00:33:45.400
You went to find a job
instead of going to school?

00:33:46.380 --> 00:33:48.180
By then, you can close the supermarket.

00:33:48.180 --> 00:33:49.180
I'll support you.

00:33:49.400 --> 00:33:51.290
And Zeqiu won't have to work late
for overtime pay

00:33:51.290 --> 00:33:52.620
and project subsidies.

00:33:55.420 --> 00:33:56.830
We can buy a big house,

00:33:57.090 --> 00:33:59.550
so the whole family
can live together again.

00:34:01.140 --> 00:34:02.900
I'm not dead from overtime work yet.

00:34:02.900 --> 00:34:04.140
Don't worry about family matters.

00:34:04.140 --> 00:34:05.670
Just take care of yourself.

00:34:08.010 --> 00:34:09.570
I'm a part of this family, too.

00:34:09.570 --> 00:34:11.170
It's my responsibility, too.

00:34:11.170 --> 00:34:12.150
I'm grown up now.

00:34:12.340 --> 00:34:13.780
Stop treating me like a child.

00:34:13.780 --> 00:34:15.780
Alright, stop it for now.

00:34:16.730 --> 00:34:18.130
What exactly is going on?

00:34:18.260 --> 00:34:18.940
Yeah.

00:34:20.730 --> 00:34:22.980
Lin Zhixia feels that you are
too overworked,

00:34:22.980 --> 00:34:25.070
and we haven't
fulfilled our duties as children,

00:34:25.070 --> 00:34:26.000
especially her.

00:34:26.500 --> 00:34:27.760
So she wants to leave school

00:34:27.760 --> 00:34:29.560
and start working to make money.

00:34:39.210 --> 00:34:39.870
Then can she

00:34:40.260 --> 00:34:42.460
still work on the research she loves?

00:34:44.170 --> 00:34:45.210
Yes, of course.

00:34:46.900 --> 00:34:47.760
You keep quiet.

00:34:48.650 --> 00:34:49.580
Let Zeqiu speak.

00:34:51.090 --> 00:34:52.489
How could it be that easy?

00:34:52.610 --> 00:34:54.469
If she goes there and they pay her,

00:34:54.530 --> 00:34:55.860
she has to do their work.

00:34:56.440 --> 00:34:57.010
Although it won't be like

00:34:57.010 --> 00:34:59.070
she has to do whatever they ask her to,

00:34:59.840 --> 00:35:01.220
her research will definitely be affected.

00:35:01.220 --> 00:35:02.570
How can that be?

00:35:03.530 --> 00:35:05.170
Wait, Zhixia,

00:35:05.900 --> 00:35:08.030
do you have any idea what you are doing?

00:35:10.420 --> 00:35:12.880
Your mom and I haven't seen
much of the world.

00:35:13.190 --> 00:35:13.630
But I

00:35:13.820 --> 00:35:14.510
do know

00:35:14.510 --> 00:35:15.800
our children well.

00:35:16.900 --> 00:35:18.540
That's right, Zhixia.

00:35:19.190 --> 00:35:21.320
Didn't Professor Shen also say before

00:35:22.230 --> 00:35:23.260
that turning your passion into a career

00:35:23.260 --> 00:35:24.460
is a kind of blessing?

00:35:24.920 --> 00:35:27.380
You've been different from other kids
since you were little.

00:35:27.380 --> 00:35:29.510
And now you're doing what you love.

00:35:30.420 --> 00:35:32.570
How could you just

00:35:32.820 --> 00:35:33.940
give up your dream

00:35:34.730 --> 00:35:36.260
for short-term gain?

00:35:41.980 --> 00:35:42.460
Hey,

00:35:43.340 --> 00:35:45.800
it's not like our family
can't get by anymore

00:35:46.420 --> 00:35:48.080
and needs you to go make money.

00:35:48.850 --> 00:35:50.550
Yes, most people

00:35:50.820 --> 00:35:52.730
in this society are busy working

00:35:52.730 --> 00:35:54.630
to make money every day.

00:35:54.630 --> 00:35:55.130
But

00:35:55.710 --> 00:35:57.600
you can realize your dream

00:35:57.800 --> 00:35:59.200
and have a decent income.

00:36:00.300 --> 00:36:02.150
You... Girl,

00:36:02.150 --> 00:36:03.320
what on earth is

00:36:03.690 --> 00:36:05.300
going on in your head?

00:36:08.010 --> 00:36:09.090
What Dad means is that

00:36:09.090 --> 00:36:10.650
you only need
to take good care of yourself.

00:36:10.650 --> 00:36:12.310
Don't worry about the family.

00:36:12.690 --> 00:36:13.210
But...

00:36:13.210 --> 00:36:13.940
No buts!

00:36:19.100 --> 00:36:21.260
Are your mom and I a burden to you now?

00:36:21.860 --> 00:36:23.550
Are we so long in the tooth
that we need you to support us?

00:36:23.550 --> 00:36:25.190
I didn't mean that.

00:36:25.920 --> 00:36:27.460
I just want everyone
to live a better life.

00:36:27.460 --> 00:36:28.920
Why are you all blaming me?

00:36:29.130 --> 00:36:31.490
Do you think we'll live a happy life

00:36:32.010 --> 00:36:33.340
if you make a sacrifice?

00:36:34.210 --> 00:36:34.900
Zhixia,

00:36:35.280 --> 00:36:36.190
do you know that

00:36:36.940 --> 00:36:38.090
in that case,

00:36:38.690 --> 00:36:39.730
your mom and I...

00:36:41.400 --> 00:36:43.380
will feel like we're a burden
to our children?

00:36:43.380 --> 00:36:44.910
What are you talking about?

00:36:45.570 --> 00:36:46.860
Our daughter didn't mean that.

00:36:46.860 --> 00:36:49.260
Look how much you've infuriated yourself.

00:36:50.300 --> 00:36:51.050
Zhixia,

00:36:52.210 --> 00:36:53.780
Mom and Dad mean

00:36:54.940 --> 00:36:56.130
that we hope

00:36:57.300 --> 00:36:58.980
you can do what you want to do,

00:37:00.130 --> 00:37:02.210
see the scenery you want to see,

00:37:03.170 --> 00:37:05.030
and live the life you want to live.

00:37:05.380 --> 00:37:07.170
This is our biggest wish.

00:37:08.610 --> 00:37:10.140
Only then will your dad and I

00:37:10.650 --> 00:37:12.340
be truly happy

00:37:12.940 --> 00:37:13.980
and satisfied.

00:37:14.530 --> 00:37:15.300
Do you get it?

00:37:31.000 --> 00:37:31.560
Alright,

00:37:31.690 --> 00:37:32.490
let's drop it.

00:37:35.170 --> 00:37:35.900
You

00:37:36.860 --> 00:37:38.570
should really think it over.

00:37:44.010 --> 00:37:45.150
There's no rush for this anyway.

00:37:45.150 --> 00:37:46.150
Just think twice.

00:37:47.460 --> 00:37:49.410
Give it some more thought.

00:37:52.050 --> 00:37:53.580
Think it through properly.

00:38:24.730 --> 00:38:25.530
What's wrong?

00:38:27.820 --> 00:38:28.620
I got scolded.

00:38:38.900 --> 00:38:39.830
Who scolded you?

00:38:41.050 --> 00:38:42.310
Firstly, it was Zeqiu,

00:38:43.500 --> 00:38:45.980
and then the three of them
took turns scolding me.

00:38:45.980 --> 00:38:48.510
In the end,
everyone was too angry to even eat.

00:38:48.650 --> 00:38:50.980
You told them
about your plan to go to work?

00:38:51.900 --> 00:38:53.360
Of course they'd be angry.

00:39:00.820 --> 00:39:02.530
You knew they would be angry?

00:39:05.260 --> 00:39:06.860
So you also disagree, right?

00:39:09.650 --> 00:39:10.580
So, Jiang Yubai,

00:39:11.380 --> 00:39:13.500
you don't approve of me
going to work at all.

00:39:13.500 --> 00:39:14.560
And you still said,

00:39:14.940 --> 00:39:17.050
"Whatever you decide to do,
I'll support you." Why?

00:39:17.050 --> 00:39:18.110
It's not like that.

00:39:18.650 --> 00:39:19.980
I really think

00:39:20.210 --> 00:39:21.780
you've got a point, too.

00:39:22.040 --> 00:39:23.700
You're not telling the truth.

00:39:25.050 --> 00:39:26.250
I'm really not lying.

00:39:26.780 --> 00:39:29.170
I just feel that as smart as you are,

00:39:29.190 --> 00:39:30.500
you must have

00:39:30.500 --> 00:39:32.160
thought everything through.

00:39:35.570 --> 00:39:36.980
Why do you always throw

00:39:36.980 --> 00:39:39.240
your principles away when it's about me?

00:39:40.950 --> 00:39:42.930
My principle is to make you happy.

00:39:51.210 --> 00:39:52.460
Do you really like me?

00:39:53.940 --> 00:39:55.570
Of course, I really like you.

00:39:56.780 --> 00:39:57.800
If you like someone,

00:39:57.800 --> 00:40:00.000
you'll help her become a better person.

00:40:00.090 --> 00:40:01.530
You knew I was wrong,

00:40:01.530 --> 00:40:02.790
but you didn't tell me.

00:40:04.130 --> 00:40:05.340
I make mistakes, too.

00:40:05.650 --> 00:40:07.860
There are also many things
I don't understand.

00:40:07.860 --> 00:40:09.720
Are you planning to never tell me?

00:40:16.900 --> 00:40:17.780
Lin Zhixia,

00:40:18.340 --> 00:40:19.170
you're right.

00:40:20.300 --> 00:40:21.300
All these years,

00:40:21.860 --> 00:40:24.390
I seem to have
gotten used to looking up to you.

00:40:24.650 --> 00:40:26.090
So I'd often go along

00:40:26.420 --> 00:40:29.020
with whatever you said
without even thinking.

00:40:29.530 --> 00:40:30.330
It's my fault.

00:40:30.690 --> 00:40:31.650
From now on,

00:40:31.940 --> 00:40:32.900
if my opinions are

00:40:32.900 --> 00:40:34.260
at odds with yours,

00:40:34.940 --> 00:40:37.000
I will be completely honest with you.

00:40:41.900 --> 00:40:42.960
No more looking up.

00:40:43.090 --> 00:40:45.550
You're already
looking down at me right now.

00:40:51.500 --> 00:40:52.340
How about now?

00:41:01.460 --> 00:41:02.590
It's all your fault.

00:41:02.870 --> 00:41:04.090
If you had told me earlier,

00:41:04.090 --> 00:41:05.680
I wouldn't have been scolded.

00:41:05.680 --> 00:41:06.510
Yeah,

00:41:07.090 --> 00:41:09.290
but I deserved to be scolded by you, too.

00:41:09.670 --> 00:41:10.470
You know what?

00:41:11.170 --> 00:41:13.830
You were quite fierce
when scolding me just now.

00:41:25.760 --> 00:41:27.360
No matter how long it's been,

00:41:27.880 --> 00:41:29.510
I will never forget that day

00:41:30.570 --> 00:41:33.030
and how I felt
when I ran towards Jiang Yubai.

00:41:34.050 --> 00:41:35.110
I finally realized

00:41:35.760 --> 00:41:37.920
that the overwhelming bittersweet ache

00:41:37.920 --> 00:41:39.180
wasn't about illness,

00:41:40.260 --> 00:41:41.120
but about love,

00:41:42.480 --> 00:41:43.280
heartache,

00:41:44.300 --> 00:41:45.210
pity,

00:41:46.460 --> 00:41:47.790
and reluctance to part.

00:41:48.590 --> 00:41:49.720
At that very moment,

00:41:50.500 --> 00:41:52.100
it felt like a crack opened up

00:41:52.820 --> 00:41:55.050
in my inner universe,

00:41:56.440 --> 00:41:59.440
revealing a new world
that I had never reached before.

00:42:00.190 --> 00:42:01.790
It turned out that all along,

00:42:02.880 --> 00:42:04.810
I had been in love with Jiang Yubai.

00:42:05.980 --> 00:42:08.040
It had grown since I didn't know when,

00:42:09.460 --> 00:42:11.050
and had already run deep.